From: Luiz Irber <luiz@earthmover.io>
Subject: [PATCH] Require ome-zarr 0.21.0

ome-zarr 0.21.0 lets `ZarrLocation` take any zarr store or a `StorePath`.
Earlier releases raise `TypeError` for a store other than `LocalStore` and
`FsspecStore`. The raster reader needs this to read a store that has no
filesystem path.

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index 03181ea..c8f15d1 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@ dependencies = [
     "networkx",
     "numba>=0.55.0",
     "numpy",
-    "ome_zarr>=0.16.0",
+    "ome_zarr>=0.21.0",
     "pandas",
     "pooch",
     "pyarrow",
